    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR2e0003-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:15:15.185+09:00">then lord and subordinate would be mutually suspicious.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:15:10.399+09:00">Those great Generals would stake claim to the armies outside [the palace],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T17:59:05.607+09:00">And inside[the palace] there would be great disorder;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:15:23.38+09:00">Using this [circumstances] among the feudal lords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T17:59:32.997+09:00">The feudallords would achieve a joining together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T17:59:37.414+09:00">They wouldsurely realize crushing Qin.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T17:59:45.298+09:00">This is theutmost desire of mine [Dan],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T17:59:57.765+09:00">But I donot know the means of entrusting this mandate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:17:42.191+09:00">I am afraid I am not adequate to be entrusted with this mission.”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:02:32.223+09:00">A long time [passed],</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:02:32.226+09:00">May you,dignitary Jing retain your intention on this [matter].”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:02:32.243+09:00">[then] Jing Ke said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:02:32.241+09:00">Your servantis of inferior talent and lowly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-04T18:02:32.241+09:00">“This is agreat matter of the state,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T17:48:26.499+09:00">Der Krinprinz schlug mit seiem Kopf vor ihm auf den Boden</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T17:49:51.055+09:00">[und] fragte ihn entschlossen nicht abzulehnen</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T18:50:20.722+09:00">Darauf hin ehrte er (der Krinpinz) Jing Ke und machte ihn zu einem hohen Minister</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T17:52:50.469+09:00">Er beherbergte ihn in einem der besten Gästeunterkünfte.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:02:12.867+09:00">Täglich besuchte der Kronprinz ihn um sich (nach seinem erten Befinden) zu erkundigen</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:39:38.405+09:00">Er versorgte ihn mit vorzüglichen Opfertieren und erlesenen Delikatessen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:23:02.181+09:00">Von Zeit zu Zeit präsentierte er ihm Wagenlenker und schöne Frauen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T18:02:34.69+09:00">Er gab all dem nach was Jing Ke begehrte,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T18:02:34.691+09:00">um so seinen Wünschen entgegen.zu kommen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-11T18:02:34.694+09:00">um so </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T18:38:57.727+09:00">Erst danach stimmte er zu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:47:03.28+09:00">Es dauerte lange;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:39:27.981+09:00">Minister Jing hatte noch keine Aufbruchsgedanken.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:38:42.504+09:00">Der Qin Geeneral Wang Jian zerstörte Zhao.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:39:11.46+09:00">Er nahm den König von Zhao gefangen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T18:35:48.883+09:00">Er nahm sein ganzes Land in Besitz.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T18:46:23.429+09:00">Er ließ seine Soldaten vorrücken, an die nördliche Grenze des Landes Vorrücken.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:44:09.885+09:00">Er erreichte die Südliche Grenze von Yan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:44:57.529+09:00">Kronprinz Dan hatte angst.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:45:56.098+09:00">Daraufhin fragte er den Minister Jing und sprach:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-6a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-12-02T17:53:46.114+09:00">Wenn die Soldaten Qins innerhalb eines Tages den Yi Fluss überqueren,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
